usr/share/licenses/amethystora-apps/crates/CRATES, each with the licence it is
used under. Most are under the MIT License or the Apache License, version 2.0;
ICU4X, which writes the dates, numbers and lists, is under the Unicode License,
version 3. The licence and notice files of each crate ship beside the list. The
windows draw the wordmark in Quicksand, under the SIL Open Font License, version
1.1, whose licence ships in usr/share/licenses/amethystora-apps.

  - gtk-rs     https://gtk-rs.org
  - ICU4X      https://github.com/unicode-org/icu4x
  - Quicksand  https://github.com/andrew-paglinawan/QuicksandFamily

